ADDITIONAL ETHICS CLAUSE - Added by Author for Academic Integrity:

1. Respect to Pharma: This project is inspired by 100 years of Pharma R&D. 
   Investment $2B, 500 scientists, 5 years per drug is the foundation. 
   This is a student learning project, not a replacement.

2. NOT A MEDICINE: Lead CUM-002 -11.2 kcal/mol is computational prediction only.
   PDB ID 4OBE 5725 atoms, Grid Center [4.645, -14.532, 46.621] Size 20 
   Reference: Ostrem et al. Nature 2013. No lab test, NOT for human use.

3. Open Science: 15 Phases V1+V2 = 30 notebooks built on 100% Mobile Phone + 
   Google Colab, TUMS HPC via BioBricks, ESM2, BioBERT, ColabFold. 
   For education and open research.

